              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Kake ore esiaai enye naa pee eretu ilayiok le Aron te nkisiayiare e nkaji Olaitoriani aaing'or Ilgorieti o too lgilat le nkaji, neituku nena pooki sinyat, neas pooki siaai te nkisiaayiare e nkaji e Nkai; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neretisho te nkisiaayiare e mukate e nkitoduaaroto, o entapa tenkaraki olasar le ntapa, naa ninye eitobirieki imukateni neitu eisuishieki, o lasar loo mukateni naatapejoki, o lasar oitushula te ilata, o ntemat pooki e nkumoi o esapuko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa keitashe ninche anaake tadekenya aaisho enashe neisis Olaitoriani, naa neijia sii etiu teipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O enkata ake pooki naishori Olaitoriani olasar opejori te nkolong e sabato, o to lapa ng'ejuk, o too nkolong'i o Sirua, terisioroto e siana nayieuni te ninche, anaake te dukuya Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neijia ninche eiko aaing'or olng'obor le ntumo o ewueji sinyati, negolie ninche ilayiok le Aron, lelo alashera lenye, te nkisiaayiare e nkaji Olaitoriani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.32"
            ]
          }
        }
